---

Third-party components
----------------------

This plugin bundles no third-party code or assets.

At runtime it uses only APIs provided by Omarchy's quickshell configuration
(qs.Ui, qs.Commons) and by Quickshell itself. Nerd Font glyphs are rendered
from the font the bar is already configured with, and application icons are
read from the desktop entries and icon themes already installed on the
machine. Neither is redistributed with this plugin.

Application logos appearing in the screenshots under docs/ are trademarks of
their respective owners and are reproduced only to illustrate the plugin's
behaviour.
